      "writtenOn": "2018-08-10T03:04:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think eventually we will want to run both dokka and doclava as separate ctx.Build statements, each depending on a metalava ctx.Build.  You should design the properties to allow enabling both doclava and metalava, even if it is not currently supported.",
      "revId": "43dd2688cc72855e80213d26bc7167aff30126b6",
